{"ticker":"AES","updated":"2026-10-23T22:34:49Z","profile":{"longName":"The AES Corporation","shortName":"The AES Corporation","sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Diversified","country":"United States","website":"https://www.aes.com","fullTimeEmployees":8336,"marketCap":10701580288,"trailingPE":5.617977,"forwardPE":6.2942696,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.81979316,"pegRatio":0.81,"targetMeanPrice":15.0,"targetHighPrice":15.0,"targetLowPrice":15.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":8,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":0.199,"earningsGrowth":null,"grossMargins":0.2027,"operatingMargins":0.18673,"profitMargins":0.1434,"totalRevenue":13054000128,"beta":0.954,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":17.65,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":13.21,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":4.7},"summary":"The AES Corporation, together with its subsidiaries, operates as a power generation and utility company. It operates through four segments: Renewables, Utilities, Energy Infrastructure, and New Energy Technologies. The company owns and/or operates power plants to generate and sell power to customers, such as utilities, industrial users, and other intermediaries; owns and/or operates utilities to generate or purchase, distribute, transmit, and sell electricity to end-user customers in the residential, commercial, industrial, and governmental sectors; and generates and sells electricity on the wholesale market, as well as investments in technologies to support leading-edge greener energy solutions. It uses various fuels and technologies to generate electricity, such as solar, hydro, wind, coal, and gas, as well as renewables comprising energy storage and landfill gas. The company owns and/or operates a generation portfolio of approximately 34,740 megawatts and distributes power to 2.7 million customers. The company operates in the United States, Chile, Dominican Republic, El Salvador, Mexico, Bulgaria, Panama, Colombia, Argentina, Vietnam, Jordan, Puerto Rico, and internationally. The company was formerly known as Applied Energy Services, Inc. and changed its name to The AES Corporation in April 2000. The AES Corporation was incorporated in 1981 and is based in Arlington, Virgini","summary_zh":"AES Corporation 及其子公司作為一家發電和公用事業公司運營。它透過四個部門運作：再生能源、公用事業、能源基礎設施和新能源技術。該公司擁有和/或經營發電廠，用於發電並向客戶（例如公用事業公司、工業用戶和其他中介機構）銷售電力；擁有和/或經營公用事業公司，以生產或購買、分配、傳輸電力，並將電力出售給住宅、商業、工業和政府部門的最終用戶客戶；並在批發市場上發電和銷售電力，以及投資技術以支持領先的綠色能源解決方案。它使用各種燃料和技術來發電，例如太陽能、水力、風能、煤炭和天然氣，以及包括儲能和垃圾掩埋氣在內的再生能源。該公司擁有和/或營運約 34,740 兆瓦的發電組合，並向 270 萬客戶配電。該公司在美國、智利、多明尼加共和國、薩爾瓦多、墨西哥、保加利亞、巴拿馬、哥倫比亞、阿根廷、越南、約旦、波多黎各和國際上開展業務。該公司前身為 Applied Energy Services, Inc.，並於 2000 年 4 月更名為 AES Corporation。 AES Corporation 成立於 1981 年，總部位於維吉尼亞州阿靈頓","sector_zh":"公用事業","industry_zh":"公用事業 - 多元化","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":13.41,"h":13.62,"l":13.31,"c":13.49,"v":6339600},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":13.49,"h":13.54,"l":13.34,"c":13.34,"v":6535900},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":13.29,"h":13.48,"l":13.22,"c":13.36,"v":7315000},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":13.44,"h":13.56,"l":13.3,"c":13.48,"v":7638700},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":13.46,"h":13.66,"l":13.43,"c":13.54,"v":8383900},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":13.35,"h":13.42,"l":13.16,"c":13.41,"v":7490700},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":13.35,"h":13.44,"l":13.19,"c":13.23,"v":6474600},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":13.32,"h":13.32,"l":12.34,"c":12.81,"v":14742500},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":12.88,"h":13.1,"l":12.67,"c":12.93,"v":12318500},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":12.99,"h":12.99,"l":12.63,"c":12.72,"v":7808200},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":12.76,"h":12.81,"l":12.56,"c":12.72,"v":6095100},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":12.76,"h":12.88,"l":12.65,"c":12.73,"v":8260800},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":12.8,"h":12.99,"l":12.78,"c":12.85,"v":10472000},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":12.8,"h":13.01,"l":12.7,"c":12.88,"v":12349600},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":12.93,"h":13.2,"l":12.87,"c":13.03,"v":14860600},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":13.01,"h":13.04,"l":12.69,"c":12.7,"v":8826000},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":12.72,"h":12.85,"l":12.33,"c":12.51,"v":12631800},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":12.61,"h"